# Same rule, one directory that predates it: the WebGL white-terminal
# before/after pair was a single bug-moment capture, never re-shot when the UI
# moved, and the regression it documented is held by
# e2e/webgl-context-loss.spec.ts. Contrast screenshots/projects-left-launcher/,
# which IS tracked on purpose - those shots were re-taken as the UI changed.
screenshots/webgl-white-terminal/
